# When a state machine or orchestrator has fields (preference)

Standing user preference: When a state machine or orchestrator has fields that must always co-occur, enforce that invariant explicitly rather than relying on convention.

## Conventions
- When a state machine or orchestrator has fields that must always co-occur, enforce that invariant explicitly rather than relying on convention.

